      "key": "STRINGS.SOCIAL.DETAILS.TRAITS_TOOLTIP",
      "text": "Some traits affect socializing: fewer arguments and brawls, better or worse reactions to mentoring, and grumpier shared sleep when schedules clash. The parenthesis after a name is that trait's effect.",
